WEBVTT

00:02:28.503 --> 00:02:30.878
I was incredibly angry.

00:02:32.613 --> 00:02:34.222
I wanted to do something,

00:02:34.246 --> 00:02:38.396
but the only thing that I could think
of doing at that time

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.623
was to study Arabic.

00:02:41.955 --> 00:02:43.112
I will admit,

00:02:43.136 --> 00:02:49.223
I was that girl in class
that wanted to know why "they" hate "us."

00:02:49.247 --> 00:02:52.638
I started studying Arabic
for very wrong reasons.

00:02:53.265 --> 00:02:55.200
But something unexpected happened.

00:02:55.224 --> 00:02:58.194
I got a scholarship to go study in Israel.

00:02:58.718 --> 00:03:01.535
So the Idaho girl went to the Middle East.